/* 应用外壳：窗口、标题栏、导航栏、内容卡、页头、通用布局。前端资源放在 frontend/。
 * Apple HIG 度量。
 */

/* ---- 窗口 ---- */

box.window {
    direction: vertical;
    cross-align: stretch;
    background: @surface;
}

box.body {
    direction: horizontal;
    cross-align: stretch;
}

/* ---- 标题栏 ---- */

box.titlebar {
    direction: horizontal;
    main-align: space-between;
    cross-align: center;
    spacing: 16px;
    height: 44px;
    padding: 10px;
    background: @surface_alt;
}

/* ⚠ 这里**没有** `text.app-title` / `text.page-title` 两条规则。
 *
 * 源码发的是 `text_label("app-title", ..., "text-body-strong")` —— 「分类名」是
 * 第三参数 `"text-body-strong"`，`"app-title"` 只是 **key**（给 hit-test 用的
 * 身份），core 不会把它当分类名发出去。于是写成 `text.app-title` 的规则一个
 * 元素都选不中，标题栏标题实际由控件层的 `text.text-body-strong` 上色。
 *
 * 两条死规则里 `text.page-title` 的值（22px / @content）与 `text.text-title`
 * **逐项相同**，所以删掉它连取值都不变；`text.app-title`（14px / 二次色）与
 * 实际生效的 `text-body-strong`（15px / 主色）不同，但那条规则从来没生效过，
 * 删掉同样不改变画面。判据见门禁 `every_stylesheet_rule_matches_something`。 */

box.search {
    direction: horizontal;
    cross-align: center;
    spacing: 8px;
    width: 340px;
    height: 34px;
    padding: 10px;
    corner-radius: 12.8px;
    corner-shape: superellipse(1.5);
    background: @card;
    border-width: 1px;
    border-color: @card_border;
}

box.search-icon {
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    icon-color: @content_secondary;
}

box.caption-bar {
    direction: horizontal;
    spacing: 0px;
}

control.caption-btn {
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    direction: horizontal;
    main-align: center;
    cross-align: center;
    background: transparent;
    corner-radius: 12.8px;
    corner-shape: superellipse(1.5);
}

control.caption-btn.hovered {
    background: @control_secondary;
}

control.caption-btn.pressed {
    background: @control_tertiary;
}

control.caption-btn.close.hovered {
    background: @critical;
}

box.caption-icon {
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    icon-color: @content;
}

/* ---- 导航栏 ---- */

box.nav-pane.compact {
    width: 56px;
    padding: 6px;
    cross-align: center;
}

box.nav-pane {
    direction: vertical;
    spacing: 6px;
    padding: 12px;
    width: 260px;
    height: 756px;
    background: @surface_alt;
}

/* ---- 内容卡 ---- */

box.content-card {
    direction: vertical;
    spacing: 20px;
    width: 1139px;
    height: 756px;
    padding: 28px;
    background: @layer;
    corner-radius: 19.2px;
    corner-shape: superellipse(1.5);
}

/* ---- 页头 ---- */

box.page-header {
    direction: horizontal;
    main-align: space-between;
    cross-align: center;
    spacing: 16px;
}

box.header-title {
    direction: horizontal;
    cross-align: center;
    spacing: 14px;
}

box.header-tools {
    direction: horizontal;
    cross-align: center;
    spacing: 10px;
}

/* ---- 通用布局 ---- */

box.section {
    direction: vertical;
    spacing: 14px;
}

box.section-body {
    direction: vertical;
    spacing: 14px;
}

/* ---- 入场动画 ---- */

box.page {
    direction: vertical;
    cross-align: stretch;
}

box.page.enter-1 {
    opacity: 0.00;
    translate-y: 8px;
}
box.page.enter-2 {
    opacity: 0.13;
    translate-y: 7px;
}
box.page.enter-3 {
    opacity: 0.26;
    translate-y: 6px;
}
box.page.enter-4 {
    opacity: 0.39;
    translate-y: 5px;
}
box.page.enter-5 {
    opacity: 0.52;
    translate-y: 4px;
}
box.page.enter-6 {
    opacity: 0.65;
    translate-y: 3px;
}
box.page.enter-7 {
    opacity: 0.78;
    translate-y: 2px;
}
box.page.enter-8 {
    opacity: 0.91;
    translate-y: 1px;
}

control.dd-morph {
    opacity: 1;
}
control.dd-morph-solid {
    opacity: 1;
}
control.dd-morph-glass {
    opacity: 1;
}
